id: flash-plugin
section: The suite's own
item: The player's process and its state: alive, wedged (stopped by a signal, as a plant) and gone are told apart, and a wedge is not read as a slow rate
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: http://192.168.1.245:8077/jihad-flash-instr.html?movie=avm2
kit: cavekit-flash.md R2
wait rect m 30
expect plugin 3 alive
plugin-signal STOP
expect plugin 3 wedged
plugin-signal CONT
expect plugin 3 alive
plugin-signal KILL
expect plugin 3 gone
